# How scripts/check_macro_pr.py checks macros against the stable OpenSAK
# release of the commit in .github/opensak-ref (see MAINTAINERS.md):
#   off   - not at all
#   warn  - warnings only: Requires-API above the stable API, beta-only
#           functions (use this while the stable release is older than the
#           macro API that betas have)
#   error - a Requires-API above the stable API fails the check; beta-only
#           functions are still warnings
# The first line without "#" is used. Switch to "error" when opensak-ref is
# moved to a new stable release.
warn
